  "currentNativeState": "Immutable registry/storage, authoritative live withdrawal revalidation, canonical durable request identity, typed owner transitions, durable withdrawal/drain controls, authenticated reference host, actionable metrics and bounded stage measurements are source implemented on the converged candidate. Capacity rejection remains a non-persistence admission outcome and does not poison current reads; withdrawal-block counters record actual publish/current-view denials rather than merely entering an uncertain state. Exact-head and ordered-parent native qualification, target-host evidence, production activation and independently governed selection/release remain separate.",
